A new unstable method, x/ping: its request, response and constant are in package
unstable, acp's API is accept-unstable-merge's, unchanged, and acp's dispatch
answers a received x/ping as a method it does not know
(0039-PLAN-five-adopter-additions-on-schema-1-25-0.md, 2f).

